OL,3,ABritish woman missing from cruise ship
OL,4,Ain Atlantic
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British woman has gone missing from a
OL,7,Fcruise ship while it was crossing the
OL,8,FAtlantic, travel operator Tui has said.
OL,10,FThe 72-year-old was last seen aboard
OL,11,FTui's Marella Voyager on Monday while
OL,12,Fthe vessel was en route to the
OL,13,FCaribbean. The ship could have
OL,14,Ftravelled hundreds of miles in the time
OL,15,Fbetween when she was last seen to when
OL,16,Fshe was reported missing.
OL,18,FStaff realised the passenger was
OL,19,Fmissing on Tuesday, when they noticed
OL,20,Fher bed had not been slept in. The
OL,21,Falarm was raised and a search carried
OL,22,Fout, Tui said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
