OL,3,ABritish woman missing from cruise ship
OL,4,Ain Atlantic
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood the missing guest was
OL,7,Fthen reported to the US Coast Guard,
OL,8,Fwhich asked the ship to continue to its
OL,9,Fcrossing rather than reverse course and
OL,10,Fsearch for the woman.
